      "id": "claim_1e874e1257084f629876cfc5fa725f42",
      "statement": "Completion is a soft-delete for the novel axis: decideNovelCompletion returns true only when reachedBottom, contentExceedsViewport, and either the novel has no series (single novel) or chapterNo equals chapterTotal (last chapter); markCompleted then sets completedAt without deleting the entry, and a later reopen preserves completedAt while updating the position.",
